    THEN JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection never says she keeps the payment, so the case outside its "Where" is answered by the twin `s 76(5A)(b) the female employee forfeits the entitlement to payment at her gross rate of pay for the forfeited period` below
    ELSE NOTHING

