-- s 76(6): termination other than by resignation, before she has used the whole of the further
-- periods of (1)(c)(ii).  Resignation is s 76(5A)'s case.
-- src:2905 | (6) Where the employment of a female employee is terminated
-- src:2906 | (whether by dismissal, upon the completion of her contract of service,
