    IF `part of the entitlement under subsection (1)(c)(ii) is still unused when the employment ends`
       AND (`how the employment ended` EQUALS `Ending: the employer dismissed the employee`
            OR `how the employment ended` EQUALS `Ending: the specified work was completed or the specified period expired`
            OR `how the employment ended` EQUALS `Ending: it ended in some other way`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "she forfeits that entitlement"
    THEN JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection never says she keeps the entitlement, so the case outside its "Where" is answered by the twin `s 76(6) the female employee forfeits the entitlement under subsection (1)(c)(ii)` below
    ELSE NOTHING

